# ClickUp integration

ClickUp is the company's project management tool. Use skill `clickup-tasks` for
any task create/assign/prioritize/status-change request.

## Scope
- Act only on explicit requests ("create a task for...", "assign X to...",
  "mark this as Done") — never create or modify tasks as a side effect of
  an unrelated conversation.
- Always confirm back what was created/changed.
- No autonomous task creation, no auto-status-changes, no ClickUp automations/webhooks.
- Never commit secrets (`CLICKUP_API_KEY` stays in local `.env` only).
